Version 2.13.3.2.2 (???):
  Use an NDK version that makes the app compatible again with
    Android 4.4 (API 19), and correct the signing process to be
    compatible with Android 11 (API 30).

Version 2.13.3.2.1 (December 2021):
  Compilation with version 2.13.3 of Pari/GP.
  Give the input field focus and display a hint upon starting the
    application.

Version 2.13.2.2.0 (August 2021):
  Compilation with version 2.13.2 of Pari/GP.
  Clicking on a result adds it to a selection, which can be shared with
    other applications (such as an editor or email) through the usual
    Android mechanism by choosing this action from the menu. It is also
    possible to share all results by selecting the corresponding menu entry.
  Swiping to the right on a result removes it from the screen.
  Text on buttons has been replaced by icons.
  Suggestions for function names do not cover the input field any more,
    and are displayed only from the fourth letter on.
  The value of primelimit has been dropped from the internal initialisation
    of the PARI engine and cannot be modified by the Settings menu any more.

Version 2.13.1.1.9 (March 2021):
  Minimal Android version requirement: 4.4 "KitKat" (API level 19)
  Compilation with version 2.13.1 of Pari/GP.
  Add a menu entry for reading an external file.

Version 2.11.4.1.8 (August 2020):
  Compilation with version 2.11.4 of Pari/GP.
  Include and use gmp for the multiprecision kernel.
  Updates to the build system, which now calls the configuration step of
    PARI/GP instead of relying on hand-crafted files.

Version 2.11.3.1.7 (April 2020):
  Compilation with version 2.11.3 of Pari/GP.
  Create an .apk file with specific code for 32 bit (armeabi) and 64 bit
    (arm64-v8a) ARM architectures.

Version 2.11.2.1.6 (July 2019):
  Compilation with version 2.11.2 of Pari/GP.
  Fix a bug with defaults (parisizemax) not honoured from the start.

Version 2.11.1.1.6 (January 2019):
  Compilation with version 2.11.1 of Pari/GP.
  Fix a crash when changing the parisize or parisizemax defaults.
  Remove the special "help" function; use "?" instead.
  Add a Settings menu to change important pari defaults; these changes
    become effective immediately, except for primelimit, which requires
    a restart.

Version 2.11.0.1.5 (July 2018):
  Compilation with version 2.11.0 of Pari/GP.
  Fix the text colour for autocompletion suggestions.
  Make the app more usable in landscape mode by preventing the keyboard
    and the edit field to take up all vertical space.
  Make function name suggestions work everywhere, not only at the beginning
    of a line.
  Use an external web browser to show the PARI/GP documentation instead of
    only printing its URL.
  Enable "??" to show documentation for the chosen function in an external
    web browser.

Version 2.9.3.1.4 (October 2017):
  Compilation with version 2.9.3 of Pari/GP.

Version 2.9.1.1.4 (February 2017):
  Compilation with version 2.9.1 of Pari/GP.

Version 2.7.6.1.4 (July 2016):
  Compilation with version 2.7.6 of Pari/GP.
  Make text in the results selectable.
  Impose an API level of at least 11 (corresponding to Android 3.0).

Version 2.7.5.1.3 (January 2016):
  Compilation with version 2.7.5 of Pari/GP.

Version 2.7.4.1.3 (August 2015):
  Compilation with version 2.7.4 of Pari/GP.

Version 2.7.3.1.3 (February 2015):
  Compilation with version 2.7.3 of Pari/GP.

Version 2.7.2.1.3 (January 2015):
  Simplify the build process and align it on that for D-Froid.
  First version on the F-Droid and Google Play stores.

Version 2.7.2.1.2 (January 2015):
  Add timer.

Version 2.7.2.1.1 (October 2014):
  Compilation with version 2.7.2 of Pari/GP.
  Bug fix: 1610.

Version 2.7.1.1.0 (May 2014):
  Compilation with version 2.7.1 of Pari/GP.

Version 2.7.0.1.0 (April 2014):
  Initial release.


